WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.843
Post Office and Courier.

2
00:00:02.123 --> 00:00:06.113
Day 40 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:07.863 --> 00:00:08.887
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:15.609
Today's goal: send letters and parcels, track deliveries, and complain about delayed or missing packages.

5
00:00:16.959 --> 00:00:17.813
Part 1.

6
00:00:18.093 --> 00:00:19.053
Key words.

7
00:00:20.303 --> 00:00:21.647
Here is a quick table:

8
00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:42.727
Word or phrase, and Meaning. parcel or package or envelope: what you send. speed post or registered post or courier: delivery services. sender or recipient or address or PIN code: who sends or who receives or where. tracking number or consignment number: number to follow the parcel. fragile: breaks

9
00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:52.265
easily. proof of delivery: signature or photo showing it was delivered. return to sender: sent back. pickup: the courier collects from your home.

10
00:00:53.615 --> 00:00:54.490
Part 2.

11
00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:55.986
Questions you'll ask.

12
00:00:57.236 --> 00:01:00.116
How much does it cost to send this parcel to Kolkata?

13
00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:02.124
How long will it take to arrive?

14
00:01:02.404 --> 00:01:03.833
Is there a faster option?

15
00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:05.607
Do I need to fill in a form?

16
00:01:05.887 --> 00:01:07.273
Can I track it online?

17
00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:08.983
Can you mark it as fragile?

18
00:01:09.263 --> 00:01:10.671
Do you offer home pickup?

19
00:01:12.021 --> 00:01:13.429
What's the maximum weight?

20
00:01:14.779 --> 00:01:15.675
Part 3.

21
00:01:15.955 --> 00:01:17.320
Questions you'll be asked.

22
00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.914
Here is a quick table:

23
00:01:20.194 --> 00:01:21.730
They ask, and You answer.

24
00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.098
What's inside?:

25
00:01:23.378 --> 00:01:27.303
Documents. / Some books and clothes. / A laptop charger.

26
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:29.247
Domestic or international?:

27
00:01:29.527 --> 00:01:31.149
Domestic, to Kolkata.

28
00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:33.370
Does it have any liquids or batteries?:

29
00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.975
No. / Yes, a small power bank.

30
00:01:36.255 --> 00:01:37.663
Do you want insurance?:

31
00:01:37.943 --> 00:01:40.375
How much does it cost? / No, thank you.

32
00:01:41.725 --> 00:01:42.643
Part 4.

33
00:01:42.923 --> 00:01:45.269
Conversation 1: sending a parcel.

34
00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:48.546
Here is how the conversation goes.

35
00:01:48.826 --> 00:01:49.999
Next, please.

36
00:01:50.279 --> 00:01:51.005
Hi.

37
00:01:51.285 --> 00:01:53.866
I'd like to send this parcel to Kolkata.

38
00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:55.362
What's inside?

39
00:01:55.642 --> 00:01:57.413
Some books and a few clothes.

40
00:01:57.693 --> 00:01:59.015
Nothing fragile.

41
00:01:59.295 --> 00:02:00.810
Okay, let me weigh it.

42
00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:02.775
It's 2.3 kilos.

43
00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.911
Speed post or ordinary?

44
00:02:06.261 --> 00:02:07.861
The conversation continues.

45
00:02:08.141 --> 00:02:09.997
How long does each one take?

46
00:02:10.277 --> 00:02:12.411
Speed post takes three to four days.

47
00:02:12.691 --> 00:02:14.483
Ordinary takes about a week.

48
00:02:14.763 --> 00:02:16.213
Speed post, please.

49
00:02:16.493 --> 00:02:17.837
How much is it?

50
00:02:18.117 --> 00:02:22.939
310. rupeesPlease fill in the recipient's address and PIN code here.

51
00:02:23.219 --> 00:02:23.901
Done.

52
00:02:24.181 --> 00:02:25.909
Can I track it online?

53
00:02:27.259 --> 00:02:28.859
The conversation continues.

54
00:02:29.139 --> 00:02:31.465
Yes, the tracking number is on your receipt.

55
00:02:31.745 --> 00:02:32.683
Thank you.

56
00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:34.993
Part 5.

57
00:02:35.273 --> 00:02:37.556
Conversation 2: missing delivery.

58
00:02:38.806 --> 00:02:40.833
Here is how the conversation goes.

59
00:02:41.113 --> 00:02:42.883
Thank you for calling QuickShip.

60
00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.443
How can I help?

61
00:02:44.723 --> 00:02:45.449
Hi.

62
00:02:45.729 --> 00:02:49.035
My parcel shows delivered, but I haven't received it.

63
00:02:49.315 --> 00:02:54.862
The tracking number is QS4471092.

64
00:02:55.142 --> 00:02:56.251
Let me check...

65
00:02:56.531 --> 00:03:01.331
It says it was delivered yesterday at 4:15 pm and received by security.

66
00:03:01.611 --> 00:03:03.553
I checked with our security.

67
00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:05.049
They don't have it.

68
00:03:06.399 --> 00:03:07.999
The conversation continues.

69
00:03:08.279 --> 00:03:09.345
I'm sorry.

70
00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:11.631
Is there a photo or a signature?

71
00:03:11.911 --> 00:03:13.639
That's what I'd like to know.

72
00:03:13.919 --> 00:03:16.287
Could you send me the proof of delivery?

73
00:03:16.567 --> 00:03:18.828
I'll raise a complaint with the delivery hub.

74
00:03:19.108 --> 00:03:21.369
You'll get an update within 48 hours.

75
00:03:21.649 --> 00:03:24.017
Could I have the complaint number, please?

76
00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:26.967
The conversation continues.

77
00:03:27.247 --> 00:03:29.807
It's C-88213.

78
00:03:30.087 --> 00:03:31.026
Thank you.

79
00:03:31.306 --> 00:03:35.253
If it isn't found, I'd like a full refund or a replacement.

80
00:03:35.533 --> 00:03:36.557
Noted.

81
00:03:36.837 --> 00:03:38.095
We'll call you back.

82
00:03:39.445 --> 00:03:40.384
Part 6.

83
00:03:40.664 --> 00:03:41.837
When things go wrong.

84
00:03:43.087 --> 00:03:44.751
The parcel arrived damaged.

85
00:03:45.031 --> 00:03:46.290
The box was open.

86
00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:49.471
It's been ten days, and the tracking hasn't changed.

87
00:03:49.751 --> 00:03:51.458
The address on the label is wrong.

88
00:03:51.738 --> 00:03:52.911
Can I change it?

89
00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:55.773
The delivery person didn't call before coming.

90
00:03:57.123 --> 00:03:58.061
Part 7.

91
00:03:58.341 --> 00:03:59.259
Practice.

92
00:04:00.509 --> 00:04:06.823
Write the 4 things to say when your parcel is missing: problem, tracking number, what you checked, what you want.

93
00:04:08.173 --> 00:04:09.048
Part 8.

94
00:04:09.328 --> 00:04:10.373
Speak today.

95
00:04:11.623 --> 00:04:14.695
Say your full address and PIN code in English, clearly.

96
00:04:14.975 --> 00:04:17.706
Practise reading a tracking number aloud in groups.

97
00:04:19.056 --> 00:04:20.592
That's the end of this lesson.

98
00:04:20.872 --> 00:04:25.523
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

99
00:04:25.803 --> 00:04:31.925
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

